## Context
A consumer project (Oeconomia climate-finance) hit the optimistic-ID-allocation
collision and an agent proposed `0134a`/`0134b` suffix tickets. The vendored
AGENTS.md had no rule against ID suffixing. Add one to the canonical asset so it
propagates to every store via `erg init` / `erg migrate`.

## Actions
1. Add an anti-suffix bullet to `src/go/assets/AGENTS.md` (the embedded source of truth).
2. `make regen-assets` to propagate to this repo's `tickets/AGENTS.md` (dogfood).

## Exit criteria
- [x] `src/go/assets/AGENTS.md` carries the anti-suffix rule
- [x] `tickets/AGENTS.md` matches the asset (selfcoherence green)
- [x] `make build` + test_selfcoherence + test_docs pass
